## What
ULTRASTABLE-DOMAIN-1 (charter pillar `reach`). Rowan bought
ultrastable.io, ultrastable.app and ultrastable.net on 2026-11-10
(Cloudflare zones created 07:52 to 07:53Z). None of them served anything
yet.

- **Front end:** ultrastable.io serves the live claims page. That is the
page with the "Directed by Rowan Brad Quni-Gudzinas" credit, plus
`/api/platform-claims`, robots and a sitemap. ultrastable.app,
ultrastable.net and the www names answer 301 to ultrastable.io. Any
other path on ultrastable.io goes to qnfo.org, so the shared header and
footer links keep working. The canonical and schema.org url follow
`product_profile.home_url`.
- **Back end:** qnfo-gateway 3.66.0 adds `ultrastableRoute`.
`scripts/attach-surface-routes.py` now handles six more hosts. For each
host with no address record it creates a proxied AAAA 100:: record, adds
a zone route to qnfo-gateway once the gateway reports 3.66 or later, and
verifies the host from outside. The workflow runs on the push that
merges this.

Follow-up in the same thread: set `product_profile.home_url` to
https://ultrastable.io and switch the personal-site, profile and CV
links, once the hosts verify.

work-claim: unreachable (proxy 403 from the session sandbox); no other
open PR touches qnfo-gateway/worker.js or
scripts/attach-surface-routes.py
probes: existing qnfo-gateway probes.json cover qnfo.org/platform; the
new hosts are verified by attach-surface-routes.py

